---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { siteData } from '../lib/data';
---

<SiteLayout title={`${siteData.brand} | About`}>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Baton Rouge Analytics &amp; Intelligence Network</h1>
      <p>
        A free, no-registration-required community for professionals and students
        in data analytics, business intelligence, and AI — meeting monthly in Baton Rouge.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel prose-panel">
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      The Baton Rouge Analytics &amp; Intelligence Network (<a href="https://gobrain.org">gobrain.org</a>) is
      a free, no-registration-required community for professionals and students in the broad field of data
      analytics and artificial intelligence. The group aims to provide a platform for growing your skillset
      in Information Technology and your professional network, and works closely with local and regional
      partners to make our monthly meetings interesting and informative.
    </p>
    <p>
      We meet every second Wednesday of the month on a wide range of topics including Power BI, data
      science, machine learning, and applied AI.
    </p>
    <p>
      The goal is to help the Baton Rouge area data community become more involved, educated, and
      capable technology professionals.
    </p>

    <h2>Partner groups</h2>
    <p>
      Meetings are held monthly in conjunction with our partner user groups:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Baton Rouge SQL Server User Group</strong> — <a href="http://brssug.org" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">BRSSUG.org</a></li>
      <li><strong>Baton Rouge .NET User Group</strong> — <a href="http://brdnug.org" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">BRDNUG.org</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Not-for-profit corporation</h2>
    <p>
      BRAIN operates under <strong>Baton Rouge User Groups</strong>, a Louisiana not-for-profit corporation
      (501c6) formed to support all user groups and user group events with financial logistics. Baton Rouge
      User Groups has supported the SQL and .NET user groups as well as Day of Data
      events. Our EIN and a W-9 are available upon request.
    </p>


    <h2>Day of Data Baton Rouge</h2>
    <p>
      BRAIN hosts an annual full-day data conference — free sessions, great speakers, and the Baton
      Rouge data community all in one place. For more information on speaking, volunteering, or attending, visit
      <a href="https://www.dayofdatabr.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">dayofdatabr.org</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Organizers</h2>
    <p>
      Organizer info coming soon — <a href={`mailto:${siteData.contactEmail}`}>contact us</a> if you'd like to get involved.
    </p>
    <p>
      Questions? Email us at <a href={`mailto:${siteData.contactEmail}`}>{siteData.contactEmail}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
